{"type":"message","id":"2db2d6f5","parentId":"239b6240","timestamp":"2026-03-03T11:44:39.463Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"MPI 没有安装。这是一个环境问题，需要用户帮助安装。让我汇报当前进展和问题。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## 进展汇报\n\n### ✅ 已完成\n1. **CMakeLists.txt** - 已更新（C++17 + compi/cgio 依赖）\n2. **src/CMakeLists.txt** - 已更新（添加 compi/cgio 链接）\n3. **mpiAdapter.h/cpp** - 已重写（使用 compi API）\n4. **cgFile.h/cpp** - 已重写（使用 cgio API）\n\n### ❌ 遇到阻塞问题\n\n**MPI 未安装** - 编译失败，系统缺少 MPI 开发环境：\n```\nCMake Error: Could NOT find MPI (missing: MPI_C_FOUND MPI_CXX_FOUND)\n```\n\n检查发现：\n- `libopenmpi-dev` 包之前被移除（状态 rc）\n- `mpicc/mpicxx` 编译器不存在\n- 需要安装 `openmpi-bin` 和 `libopenmpi-dev`\n\n### 🔧 需要的帮助\n\n**请运行以下命令安装 MPI：**\n```bash\nsudo apt-get update\nsudo apt-get install -y openmpi-bin libopenmpi-dev\n```\n\n安装完成后，我将：\n1. 重新运行 cmake 配置\n2. 编译项目\n3. 运行测试验证\n\n### 📝 其他说明\n- cgFile.cpp 中部分 cgio API 调用可能需要根据实际接口调整（如 `get_connectivity_view` 的具体用法）\n- 编译通过后可能需要微调 API 调用以匹配 cgio 的实际实现"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":71915,"output":361,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72276,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772538260621}}
